# Optional package-index distribution

The original consumer migration record is omitted from this source successor because it contains private operational details. No index, consumer inventory, delivery status or authorization is inferred from it.

Read [release guidance](../../docs/dev/RELEASE.md) and [source boundary](../../docs/source-successor.md). Before an explicitly authorized migration, identify the destination index, package names/versions, authentication mechanism and actual consuming environments. Prepare and validate packages locally before seeking any required publication or consumer-change authorization. Never commit credentials or infer a publishing grant from a planning request.
